        "nodeType": "text_input",
        "properties": {
          "message": "Decide what I should do next in Full autonomy from the supplied current context. This is a self-directed decision, not a response to a new user instruction. Consider Robot Status and any unfinished objective, recent conversation, private reflection, verified robot-action outcomes, active desires, Environment Bridge facts, valid current visual evidence, and my active persona together. The availableAutonomyTasks entries describe the tasks I can currently start. Choose by present relevance and expected usefulness, not by list position, novelty, or rotation. Continue an unfinished objective when the context supports useful progress; when no objective needs attention, choose another task that fits the current circumstances and persona. Do not invent current physical facts.\n\nSelect robot-autonomy-executor only for a high-level embodied intention; state its intended effect and relevant context in instruction, without choosing a robot command or writing a movement plan. For a catalog agent task, select its exact taskId and leave instruction empty because that agent owns its work. Select none only when a brief conversational response is itself the appropriate next action. response is optional and may contain one concise natural sentence. Return only the requested JSON.",
